a-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"width: 261.969px;\">4H</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td style=\"width: 254.031px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"width: 254.031px;\">Wheel Material</td>\n<td style=\"width: 261.969px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"width: 261.969px;\">Flashing PU Wheel+ Rubber wheel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td style=\"width: 254.031px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"width: 254.031px;\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Braking</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 261.969px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"width: 261.969px;\">Foot brake</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td style=\"width: 254.031px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"width: 254.031px;\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">IP Rating</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 261.969px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"width: 261.969px;\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">IP64</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0588/3592/7218/files/Mini_Blue_A__B2_V01_220511.jpg?v=1652343283\" alt=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0588/3592/7218/files/Mini_Blue_A__B1_V01_220511.jpg?v=1652342420\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0588/3592/7218/files/Mini_Blue_A__B1_V01_220511.jpg?v=1652342420\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0588/3592/7218/files/Mini_Blue_B2_V01_220511.jpg?v=1652341768\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0588/3592/7218/files/Mini_Pink_B3_V01_220512.jpg?v=1652341902\" alt=\"\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0588/3592/7218/files/Mini_Pink_B3_V01_220512.jpg?v=1652341902\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0588/3592/7218/files/Mini_Blue_B5_V01_220511.jpg?v=1652341939\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0588/3592/7218/files/A_-970x600-03.jpg?v=1651732295\" alt=\"\" d