olid tire</span><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0536/2417/6817/files/d61752e527354608fb4d7a948fab462a.png?v=1615530376\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0536/2417/6817/files/d61752e527354608fb4d7a948fab462a.png?v=1615530376\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Electronic brake + rear wheel foot brake</span><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0536/2417/6817/files/dda55bc491a2e0f7e006208960c1de12.png?v=1615530475\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0536/2417/6817/files/dda55bc491a2e0f7e006208960c1de12.png?v=1615530475\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Front and rear lights</span><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0536/2417/6817/files/c3a04563d2e18ea66a0fbcd039e3eba6.png?v=1615530513\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0536/2417/6817/files/c3a04563d2e18ea66a0fbcd039e3eba6.png?v=1615530513\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Maximum degree of climbing 20 °</span><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0536/2417/6817/files/07e7d50cfc079991c520aed349ba6b7a.png?v=1615530541\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopifycdn.net/s/files/1/0536/2417/6817/files/07e7d50cfc079991c520aed349ba6b7a.png?v=1615530541\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">IP54 Waterproof levels</span><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0536/2417/6817/files/weight.jpg?v=1616656577\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0536/2417/6817/files/weight.jpg?v=1616656577\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Max load 264lbs</span><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0536/2417/6817/files/c8577a1df210126991a8c79837c61c3f.jpg?v=1616656603\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0536/2417/6817/file