tart gliding, the electric scooter will move forward with safe speed not exceeding 8.5mph, and the capacity for trips up to 19 miles on one charge.</li>\n<li>【<strong>Fantastic LED Flashing Wheels</strong>】: No battery needed. The front 2 wheels are designed as a self-generated power system. they will automatically light up when kids start to ride that shines bright and stands out. Your kids will love this special feature and have a lot of fun while playing.</li>\n<li>【<strong>Lean To Steer Mechanism</strong>】: Helps your child develop balance skills, coordination, and more. The Electric Scooter features easy maneuvering with lean-to-steer technology, which means the kid''s scooter is controlled by leaning rather than turning the steering wheel.</li>\n<li>【<strong>Adjustable Handlebar</strong>】: Grow With Your Kids. MINI electric scooter for kids has 3 levels adjustable height to suit your child as grown. Easily adjust the handlebars to heights between 24.8\"- 33.8\", electric scooter which very suitable for kids 3 to 12 years old.</li>\n<li>【<strong>A great gift for your child</strong>】: Whether your kid is brand new to scooters or ready to upgrade to a more advanced model, they will love the independence of cruising around on their own. The iSinwheel electric scooter will be perfect for kids, get the kids to enjoy the fun of gliding.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"subtitle-features\"></ul>\n<table border=\"1\" style=\"width: 534px;\" height=\"430\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"width: 534px;\">\n<tbody data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td style=\"width: 254.031px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"width: 254.031px;\"><strong>Specification</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 261.969px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"width: 261.969px;\"><strong>Parameters</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td style=\"width: 254.031px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"width: 254.031px;\"><span data-mce-fragmen